# Compiled Go binaries never belong in the image. Upstream committed a 63 MB
# `main` and a 12 MB `backfill-event-location` into the repository root; both
# are removed from the workspace, and this stops a rebuild from a dirty
# checkout putting them back. `bin/` is where the harness and the reference
# both build to, so a build run before `docker build` must not travel either.
workspace/main
workspace/backfill-event-location
workspace/bin/

# Nothing graded lives in the build context, and nothing graded should be able
# to arrive here by a later widening of a COPY.
**/__pycache__/
**/.local/
